WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.300
Installer. One command into the district's own Cloudflare account. npx launch-educate-os installs a signed EducateOS release with the district's own credentials.

2
00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:16.000
npx launch-educate-os: Install, plan, upgrade, rollback and doctor. The answers file it writes never holds secrets.

3
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:26.600
doctor, with no token: It fetches the newest release, r000002, and verifies its signature against the release keys built into the installer.

4
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:41.600
plan · real output, 2026-11-04: Read-only checks of the account, then every change it would make. Recorded on an owner-run Cloudflare account; nothing was changed.

5
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:51.833
plan · what Cloudflare bills: It lists what Cloudflare will bill the district for. A full install has completed in an owner-run account; no district has run one yet.

6
00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:55.833
Start with the demo. Install when you're ready. educateos.io/demo · npx launch-educate-os · Apache-2.0
